fit-content;"> for the year ended June 30, 2025. The benefit for the year ended June 30, 2026 consists primarily of the release of uncertain tax positions related to a lapse of the statute of limitations and the reduction of the naked credit deferred tax liability. The expense for the year ended June 30, 2025 consists of the recognition of income tax expense related to the deferred tax liability with an indefinite reversal period. This is offset by the income tax benefit recognized from the reversal of the prior year's income tax expense, resulting from provision-to-return adjustments.</span></p></ix:nonNumeric></div></div>
